# The Network: Nintendo
#
# Expects a gaming policy.
#
# Accounts, the eShop, Switch Online and the game services under nintendo.net. The download CDN cdn.nintendo.net lives in Direct/Download.list. nintendo.cn and nintendoswitch.cn, the Tencent-operated mainland service, fall to the .cn rule. The Switch reaches its NAT traversal and push servers under srv.nintendo.net by bare address, because the profile's always-real-ip hands it real answers; those flows never match a name rule and need a device rule in the profile if they are to stay direct.

